sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as Windows
    participant FRE as First Run Experience
    participant RH as Runtime Host
    participant ID as Identity & Entitlement
    participant BE as Account Backend
    participant M as SplitOS Manager
    participant PAY as Payment Provider
    participant MS as Mode State

    W->>RH: Windows user session available
    RH->>ID: Resolve Windows user association
    alt No SplitOS account association
        RH->>FRE: Start onboarding
        U->>FRE: Sign in / Create account
        FRE->>BE: Authenticate account
        BE-->>FRE: Authenticated account
        FRE->>ID: Associate Windows user ↔ SplitOS account
    end

    ID->>BE: Refresh entitlement evidence
    BE-->>ID: Account / entitlement evidence
    ID->>ID: Evaluate ManagedRuntimeAccess

    alt FREE
        ID-->>RH: DISABLED
        RH-->>W: Keep normal Windows Desktop
    else PRO
        ID-->>RH: ENABLED
        RH->>MS: Make mode selection available
        U->>RH: Select WORK or GAME
    end

    opt FREE → PRO upgrade
        U->>M: Upgrade
        M->>BE: Create hosted checkout
        BE-->>M: Checkout session
        M->>PAY: Open checkout
        U->>PAY: Complete payment
        PAY->>BE: Validated payment evidence
        Note over M,ID: Browser return/callback only triggers refresh
        M->>ID: Refresh entitlement
        ID->>BE: Read new entitlement evidence
        BE-->>ID: PRO evidence
        ID-->>RH: ManagedRuntimeAccess ENABLED
        RH->>MS: Setup / mode selection
    end